\begin{enumerate}
  \item Draw the circuit diagram of a half‑adder using only XOR and AND gates.
  \item Build a \(2\!:\!1\) multiplexer with NAND gates only.
  \item Complete the truth table for a \(3\!:\!8\) decoder and indicate which output is high for input \(101\).
  \item Design a priority encoder that resolves the case when \(D_{2}\) and \(D_{0}\) are both high.
  \item Write the Boolean expressions for a one‑bit comparator and verify them with a truth table.
\end{enumerate}

